nutrition", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 4, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Monitor treats to be less than 10% of daily calories ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null}, {"type": "listitem", "value": 5, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Regular vet checks to establish ideal weight targets and catch weight gain early", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null}], "listType": "number", "direction": null}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null, "textFormat": 1}}, "heading": "Digital Thermal Imaging", "subheading": "Spot inflammation before symptoms appear"}], "blockName": "", "blockType": "iconAccordions"}, "format": "", "version": 2}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"tag": "h2", "type": "heading", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "DIET", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Diet plays a fundamental role in your dog’s joint health. Feeding an inflammatory diet is going to increase inflammation in the body and impact your dog’s mobility. For optimal joint health, focus on reducing whole-body inflammation through diet. Switching from highly processed foods to fresh diets is one of the quickest ways to improve mobility by eliminating the daily inflammatory burden on your dog’s body. Fresh, varied diets support healthy microbiome development, while ultra-processed foods damage gut bacteria and create chronic inflammation throughout the body. ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "There are several foods and supplements that have shown to prove to be helpful for joints:", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "block", "fields": {"id": "68f18786577f756260829d52", "items": [], "heading": "Slider", "blockName": "", "blockType": "collectionItemSlider", "usePlaceholders": true, "widthConstraint": true, "placeholderCount": 5, "placeholderImage": 2, "placeholderTitle": "Name"}, "format": "", "version": 2}, {"tag": "h2", "type": "heading", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "MANAGEMENT", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 1, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textFormat": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "When your dog is living with joint disease, a multimodal approach can significantly improve their quality of life and may even reduce dependence on pharmaceutical interventions. The goal shifts from prevention to managing existing conditions while supporting the body's natural healing processes. Physical rehabilitation is irreplaceable in joint disease management, focusing on targeted exercises to strengthen muscles, improve range of motion, and build endurance. The philosophy is clear: there is no pill that can replace the physical act of moving the body to repair, rebuild, and restore musculoskeletal function.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}, {"mode": "normal", "text": "Small changes to your dog’s environment, diet, and exercise routine can greatly improve your dog’s quality of life with a joint disease.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "linebreak", "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "block", "fields": {"id": "68f18811577f756260829d53", "items": [{"id": "68f188122b163d67b225776e", "icon": "massage", "content": {"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Lorem Ipsum.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}, "heading": "Physical Rehabilitation", "subheading": "Maintaining ideal weight is the #1 factor"}, {"id": "68f1882a2b163d67b2257770", "icon": "bolt", "content": {"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Lorem Ipsum.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}, "heading": "Pulsed Electromagnetic Field (PEMF)", "subheading": "Early detection prevents severe progression"}, {"id": "68f188362b163d67b2257772", "icon": "acupuncture", "content": {"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Lorem Ipsum.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}, "heading": "Acupuncture", "subheading": "Right exercise builds strength without damage"}, {"id": "68f188452b163d67b2257774", "icon": "air", "content": {"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Lorem Ipsum.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}, "heading": "Ozone Therapy", "subheading": "Proper nail length maintains healthy joints"}, {"id": "68f188542b163d67b2257776", "icon": "water", "content": {"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Lorem Ipsum.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}, "heading": "Chiropractic Care", "subheading": "Timing affects joint development"}, {"id": "68f188612b163d67b2257778", "icon": "pill", "content": {"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Lorem Ipsum.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}, "heading": "Pharmaceuticals", "subheading": "Simple changes prevent slips, trips, and falls"}, {"id": "68f188702b163d67b225777a", "icon": "sunny", "content": {"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Lorem Ipsum.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}, "heading": "Laser Therapy", "subheading": "Prevention is more effective than treatment"}, {"id": "68f188812b163d67b225777c", "icon": "pulmonology", "content": {"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Lorem Ipsum.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}, "heading": "Hyperbaric Oxygen Therapy", "subheading": "Spot inflammation before symptoms appear"}], "blockName": "", "blockType": "iconAccordions"}, "format": "", "version": 2}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "block", "fields": {"id": "68f18898577f756260829d54", "items": [], "heading": "Slider", "blockName": "", "blockType": "collectionItemSlider", "usePlaceholders": true, "widthConstraint": true, "placeholderCount": 5, "placeholderImage": 2, "placeholderTitle": "Osteoarthritis"}, "format": "", "version": 2}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}	68f185df2b163d67b225775c	\N	container
3	55	version.layout	372	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"tag": "h2", "type": "heading", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "INTRODUCTION", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Joint disease is one of the leading causes of chronic pain in dogs today, yet many of the risk factors are entirely preventable through informed early intervention. As a dog parent, you have more control over your dog's joint health than you might think. Simple lifestyle choices throughout the different stages of your dog’s life can slow joint damage and keep your dog moving well.  ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Being proactive with nutrition, controlled exercise, and lifelong joint support is far more effective than waiting until your dog is already showing signs of stiffness or lameness. Pain often doesn’t look like limping or crying out. It may look like subtle weight shifts, compensatory movements, and inefficient gaiting. These are ways that dogs learn to cope with their pain. Investigating any potential pain or discomfort should be part of every dog’s care, and should be revisited often.", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}, {"type": "block", "fields": {"id": "68f2998b3aab1650e1c7560b", "tabs":