9	16	Dr. Laurie Coger	{"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Dr. Coger is an integrative and functional medicine veterinarian, dog owner, trainer, and breeder with a special interest and advanced training in nutrition. Her mission is to guide owners down the natural dog care path helping them to become educated and empowered advocates for their dog’s health. She is the founder of the ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}, {"id": "691384cdc4ed0f5672c89627", "type": "link", "fields": {"url": "https://healthydogworkshop.com/", "newTab": false, "linkType": "custom"}, "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 3, "children": [{"mode": "normal", "text": "Healthy Dog Expo", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 8, "version": 1}], "direction": null}, {"mode": "normal", "text": ", the nation's foremost natural dog health educational event. ", "type": "text", "style": "", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "version": 1}], "direction": null, "textStyle": "", "textFormat": 0}], "direction": null}}	2025-11-12 14:46:43.848-03	2025-11-05 19:25:43.945-03	NATURAL DOG CARE
